# SEO

## Every public page
- Unique `<title>` (≈60 chars when possible) and meta description.
- Canonical URL from env-aware `base_url` / site config.
- Open Graph: `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:url`, **`og:image`** (required).
- English only (see this-project-core).

## Registry → sitemap
- List indexable routes in a config registry (`tools.php`, `games.php`, guides, …).
- `/sitemap.xml` is **generated** from that registry — never hand-edit the XML.
- `robots.txt` (or robots action) includes a `Sitemap:` line pointing at the sitemap.
- One canonical host per site (www or bare — match redirects). Never change a public path without a **301**.

## Structured data
- JSON-LD on the home page and on key entity pages (tool, game, FAQ) when natural.

## Noindex
- Results, thank-you, empty search, and pure utility query URLs: `noindex` when they should not rank.
